# CMS69 Asserted Concepts

library "CMS69 Asserted".

// "Pregnancy or Other Related Diagnoses" is a valueset (declared in
// CMS69 Terminology) referenced as a classification argument in
// `documented as` narrative. Declared as a concept wrapper so the
// narrative ref resolver finds it. Future: catalog signature for
// DocumentedAs may distinguish valueset args from concept args directly.
concept "Pregnancy or Other Related Diagnoses":
- type is Condition.
- value type is CodeableConcept.
- coded from "CMS69 Terminology"."Pregnancy or Other Related Diagnoses".


